== Method
#plan[
  - Evidence hierarchy: code text > standards > manufacturers' instructions and listings > textbooks > utility service rules > trade press > forums.
  - Forums are evidence of *practice*, not of what is correct. Each forum source is coded (site, date, claim, whether the poster gives a source).
  - Search terms, sites and date ranges recorded so the survey can be repeated.
]

